@startuml sequence_set_after
' Этап 9: SET k v после рефакторинга. Журнал — порт ILogSink: в работе это
' AppendOnlyLog, в тестах — MemoryLog. Учёт объёма — MemoryBudget, время
' записи — IClock.
autonumber
actor Клиент
participant "main" as Main
participant "Server" as Server
participant "RequestCache" as Cache
participant "CommandRegistry" as Registry
participant "set_value()" as Handler
participant "BasicStore" as Store
participant "MemoryBudget" as Budget
participant "IClock" as Clock
participant "IStorageEngine" as Engine
participant "ILogSink" as Sink

== запуск ==
Main -> Main : make_server(Config)\n(движок, журнал, часы — здесь)
== команда ==
Клиент -> Main : строка «SET k v»
Main -> Server : handle(line)
Server -> Cache : get(line)
Cache -> Registry : bind(tokenize(line))
Cache --> Server : shared_ptr<Request>
Server -> Handler : request->command()(store_)
Handler -> Store : set("k", Value("v"))
Store -> Budget : require(key, after(removed, added))
Store -> Clock : now()
Store -> Engine : put("k", Entry{value, version, touched})
Store -> Budget : commit(used)
Handler --> Server : Reply::ok()
Server -> Sink : append("SET k v")
Server --> Main : Response
Main --> Клиент : OK
@enduml
